<title>USA: Colonial BancGroup raises $70 million.</title>
<headline>Colonial BancGroup raises $70 million.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colonial BancGroup said the company has sold $70 million of non-convertible capital securities.</p>
<p>The funds will be used for general business purposes, including possible acquisitions, it said.</p>
<p>The 30-year, 8.92 percent fixed rate Series A Capital Securities are callable after 10 years. Cash distributions will be paid semi-annually beginning July 15, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
